  "details": "Right now, settings search goes through the names of the settings in the language that the user set. It should additionally search through the original English setting names too (behind the scenes). \n\nThis will help tighten the gap between people who prefer to use English and those using a translated version of the game. \n\nExample scenario being a person trying to explain what setting to change to someone. A situation I encountered many many times. I believe many people will prefer to keep the UI in English, even tho they know a different language, and this could cause friction in some social situations.",
